{"seq":2,"slug":"boss-tuning","title":"数值与调校：把「感觉太难」变成可测量的问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/practice/boss-tuning","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数值与调校-把-感觉太难-变成可测量的问题\">数值与调校：把「感觉太难」变成可测量的问题</h1><p>「这个 Boss 感觉有点难」是策划会上最没用的一句反馈——难在哪个阶段？是伤害太高还是窗口太窄？是普遍卡关还是只有某类 Build 卡？调校的全部工作，就是把这种模糊的主观感受，翻译成血量、伤害、帧数、TTK 这些可测量、可复现、可迭代的数字。本篇讲 Boss 数值的推算顺序、遥测驱动的诊断，以及为什么调 Boss 要「先调时间，再调数值」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从目标战斗时长反推数值\">核心概念：从目标战斗时长反推数值</h2><p>新手调 Boss 常犯的错，是先拍一个血量再看着办。正确的顺序是反过来：先定<strong>目标战斗时长</strong>（这场战斗预期打多久才有分量感），再由它反推血量、伤害等一切数值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[定目标战斗时长 T] --&gt; B[定玩家预期 DPS]&#10;  B --&gt; C[反推 Boss 血量 H = DPS × T]&#10;  A --&gt; D[定目标容错次数 n]&#10;  D --&gt; E[反推 Boss DPS&lt;br/&gt;有效血池 / T]&#10;  C --&gt; F[首轮数值]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[内部玩测 + 遥测]&#10;  G --&gt; H{死亡分布/耗时&lt;br/&gt;是否符合预期}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[定位偏差段 局部调整]&#10;  I --&gt; G&#10;  H --&gt;|是| J[锁定 进入外部测试]\">flowchart TD\n  A[定目标战斗时长 T] --&gt; B[定玩家预期 DPS]\n  B --&gt; C[反推 Boss 血量 H = DPS × T]\n  A --&gt; D[定目标容错次数 n]\n  D --&gt; E[反推 Boss DPS&lt;br/&gt;有效血池 / T]\n  C --&gt; F[首轮数值]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[内部玩测 + 遥测]\n  G --&gt; H{死亡分布/耗时&lt;br/&gt;是否符合预期}\n  H --&gt;|否| I[定位偏差段 局部调整]\n  I --&gt; G\n  H --&gt;|是| J[锁定 进入外部测试]</pre><p>核心公式很朴素。设目标战斗时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、玩家预期每秒输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>DPS</mtext><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DPS}_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 Boss 血量应约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>DPS</mtext><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = \\text{DPS}_p \\times T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>反过来，玩家的击杀时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TTK</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mtext>DPS</mtext><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TTK} = H / \\text{DPS}_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTK</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/boss-archetypes\">Boss 原型</a> 的 DPS 检查）。Boss 对玩家的输出则由「目标容错」反推：若希望玩家犯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次致命错才死，Boss 单次有威胁招约造成玩家血池的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>先时间后数值</strong>的意义在于：战斗时长是玩家能直接感知的体验量，血量只是它的派生物；盯着体验量调，才不会陷入「加了 2000 血结果战斗从 90 秒变 150 秒变得又臭又长」的陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"帧级调校-窗口比血量更影响手感\">帧级调校：窗口比血量更影响手感</h2><p>数值分两层：<strong>宏观数值</strong>（血量、伤害、TTK）决定战斗的「长度和致命度」，<strong>帧级数值</strong>（前摇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{tel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{rec}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、判定宽容度）决定战斗的「手感和公平感」。后者往往比前者更影响玩家评价——一个血量偏高的 Boss 顶多让人觉得「肉」，但一个前摇短了 3 帧的招，能让整场战斗从「爽」变成「不公平」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>调大的影响</th>\n<th>调小的影响</th>\n<th>敏感度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前摇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{tel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>更易读、更公平</td>\n<td>更逼反应、易「不公平」</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{rec}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>反击窗口更宽、更稳</td>\n<td>更压迫、不能贪刀</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>招式伤害</td>\n<td>更致命、容错更低</td>\n<td>更宽容、缺压迫</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boss 血量</td>\n<td>战斗更长、可能拖沓</td>\n<td>更短促</td>\n<td>低（体验钝感）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定框宽容度</td>\n<td>更容易躲开</td>\n<td>更精确、易冤枉</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>调校的一条铁律：<strong>帧级参数一次只动几帧，且优先于血量</strong>。前摇、恢复这些参数的敏感度极高，跨过可躲下限（见 <a href=\"../structure/telegraph-tells\">预告与可读性</a> 的反应窗口）就会从「难」跌进「不公平」。血量则相反，玩家对它相当钝感，是最后才微调的粗调旋钮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"遥测驱动诊断-让数据指出卡点\">遥测驱动诊断：让数据指出卡点</h2><p>设计师是这个 Boss 的绝对高手，他的手感早已脱离新手，靠他自己「感觉」调难度必然失真（见 <a href=\"../pacing/difficulty-curve\">难度曲线</a> 结尾）。可靠的诊断必须靠玩测遥测。要埋的关键指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>死亡热力图</strong>：玩家死于哪个阶段、哪个招式、场地哪个位置。某一招的死亡占比畸高，通常意味着它预告不清或数值超标，而非「这里就该难」。</li>\n<li><strong>阶段耗时分布</strong>：各阶段的平均停留时间。某阶段异常长 → 可能是 DPS 检查过严或该阶段太肉；异常短 → 可能被「阶段跳过」（见 <a href=\"../structure/phase-design\">阶段设计</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>首杀尝试次数分布</strong>：多数玩家几次通关？长尾（一小撮玩家几十次还没过）往往指向某个特定卡点或 Build 不友好。</li>\n<li><strong>回血使用率</strong>：玩家实际喝了几瓶药、有多少次想喝没喝上——直接检验 <a href=\"../pacing/checkpoints-recovery\">检查点与重试</a> 的回血经济是否名副其实。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套「埋点—收集—定位偏差段—局部调整」的循环，和战斗系统调校的方法论完全一致，可复用 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/balance-feel/telemetry-combat-tuning\">战斗系统·遥测驱动调优</a> 的通用管线。区别只在于 Boss 的指标要细化到「单招粒度」，因为 Boss 战的死亡往往集中在一两个招式上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"难度档位与调校的正交性\">难度档位与调校的正交性</h2><p>如果游戏提供多个难度档位，调校要保证它们<strong>正交于设计</strong>——即改档位只改数值旋钮（血量、伤害、容错），不破坏招式的可读性和公平性内核。危险做法是「困难模式=所有前摇缩短」，这等于把「难」偷换成「不公平」，正是玩家最反感的。稳健的档位化通常是：调整 Boss 伤害倍率、玩家有效血池、以及可选地增删部分高阶招（而非削减既有招的预告）。这条原则与 <a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/curves/tuning-numbers\">难度平衡·数值调校</a> 一脉相承——档位是给数值加系数，不是重做手感。落地时，这些系数最好数据驱动、可热更，方便上线后据线上遥测继续微调，具体的产线组织见 <a href=\"boss-design-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调校顺序是「先时间后数值」：先定目标战斗时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>DPS</mtext><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=\\text{DPS}_p\\times T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 反推血量；盯着可感知的体验量调，避免战斗被拖沓。</li>\n<li>数值分宏观（血量/伤害/TTK，决定长度致命度）与帧级（前摇/恢复/判定，决定手感公平感）；帧级敏感度更高，一次只动几帧且优先于血量。</li>\n<li>设计师是绝对高手，手感必然失真；靠遥测诊断——死亡热力图、阶段耗时、首杀尝试分布、回血使用率——把主观「难」定位到单招粒度。</li>\n<li>难度档位要正交于设计：只调数值旋钮，绝不靠「缩短所有前摇」把难度偷换成不公平。</li>\n<li>埋点—定位—局部调整的循环可复用战斗系统的遥测管线，系数最好数据驱动可热更。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../pacing/difficulty-curve\">难度曲线</a> —— 遥测诊断的三种曲线失败形态。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"boss-design-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> —— 数据驱动系数与热更如何嵌入产线。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../combat-system-design/balance-feel/telemetry-combat-tuning\">战斗系统·遥测驱动调优</a> —— 埋点—定位—调整的通用管线。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/curves/tuning-numbers\">难度平衡·数值调校</a> —— 难度档位作为数值系数的通用原则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数值与调校：把「感觉太难」变成可测量的问题","id":"数值与调校-把-感觉太难-变成可测量的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从目标战斗时长反推数值","id":"核心概念-从目标战斗时长反推数值"},{"level":2,"text":"帧级调校：窗口比血量更影响手感","id":"帧级调校-窗口比血量更影响手感"},{"level":2,"text":"遥测驱动诊断：让数据指出卡点","id":"遥测驱动诊断-让数据指出卡点"},{"level":2,"text":"难度档位与调校的正交性","id":"难度档位与调校的正交性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"战斗 AI 与脚本：让 Boss 的决策活起来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/practice/boss-ai"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：从立项到上线，以及哪些事不该做","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/practice/boss-design-in-practice"}}